LiveRepair: CloneAndRecover, RecoverAll, DiskHealth, TM5 for Linux, FastCopy Linux,
LinBurn (ImgBurnLinux), Rufux (WindowsUSBLinux) and VirtConvert&Create.

The desktop starts on tty1. Command line tools: cnrctl, recoverctl, diskctl, tm5linux-cli,
fastcopy-linux --no-ui, virtconvert. The user "live" has no password and may use sudo.
